      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#0–#1 · the Personal Poetry Corpus: ten earlier works, P0–P5, seven journal works",
          "title": "A word that can return to its speaker",
          "italic": "The poems demonstrate returns in different bodies: play reopening after checkmate, knowing restored to its conjugal joy, the One keeping its offices through changed case.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The corpus gives twenty-three individual works within one authored whole: ten undated earlier works, the six-work P0→P5 composition, seven dated journal works from March–June 2026. FT-P01 plays to checkmate and asks to play again — the final repetition of play reopening what the ending closed. FT-P02 gives the Unknown relative knowability and removes final possession from the Known, whose exclusive focus spits back the empty husk; Knowing itself is the Mystery, the conjugal joy of Known and Knower. FT-P03 passes \"it",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "takes one to know one\" through three changes of case to no-one, One knowing One. FT-P04 breathes the Two Ones in one line. FT-P07 dreams institutions which respect their constitution and do not devour the humanity that made and makes them — the present tense keeping originating act from becoming exhausted credit. FT-P08 wakes by getting tired; FT-P09's freedom moves from a rule to itself to the Rule of The Self, the message passing the pigeonhole; FT-P10 lets slighting approach slightly without gaining final authority.\n\nOccurrences: checkmate and the replayed game (FT-P01, #5→0); the husk (FT-P02); the three cases of one (FT-P03); the 0/1 line (FT-P04, developed at #1); the devouring institution (FT-P07, returned at #4's black sun).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
