      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#4 · the adopted social-power unit; A29, A24, A25, A32 (human-amplified: yes for the adopted operations)",
          "title": "The black sun and the radiating star",
          "italic": "The image demonstrates capture against circulation: the public work channel becomes performance while effective decision moves into concealed play — and the return must let work, attention and judgement come back as generative capacity.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "Attention and labour move toward a centre; at the public edge actions present as work done for others, while deeper the power to decide their use is less visible. The black sun gathers capture: energy received without answering circulation. The radiating star changes the destination: what reaches the centre becomes available outward as generative power. The adopted unit gives the contrast a complete Work/Play inversion — public work as performance, decision in concealed play — over four concentric rings: outer philanthropy at Neptune's distance, capital's stabilising gravity at Jupiter's, inner fixers at Mercury's proximity,",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "the innermost corona where mutual vulnerability binds. The false accounting excludes interior experience as unledgerable, then treats exclusion as absence. The attention sequence runs cynicism, exhaustion, blankness — a field ready for re-inscription; exposing the performance alone has not returned power. The city/bomb/surveillance/counterfeit unit differentiates destruction, capture and forged source-image as distinct failures; the God-image enters as the cultural question of what a collective places at the source of organised power. Particular allegations in the raw unit require their own evidence and are not reproduced.\n\nOccurrences: the black sun's intake and the star's radiance (#4); the four rings (#4); the attention sequence (#4); the city/bomb/surveillance/counterfeit distinctions (#4, returned at #5→0).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
